        <mxCell id="r17c0" value="4b. 员工或角色已改名、员工停用或授权失效：在授权范围内仍展示对应历史。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
